1
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

2
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:09,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I can't keep writing
things off as beyond my depth.</b></font>

3
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:11,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[plane whirring]
-I'll try anything I can.</b></font>

4
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I volunteer.</b></font>

5
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please, let me!</b></font>

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

7
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:21,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

8
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
You're volunteering?</b></font>

9
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
You, actually want to be</b></font>

10
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-on the committee?
-[SATORU] Like, for real?</b></font>

11
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAMAKIRI] My hero!
-[TAO] Totally works for me.</b></font>

12
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:31,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TAO] Ishimori's smart.
-[TONBO] Yeah,</b></font>

13
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>though she doesn't get "vibes."</b></font>

14
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:33,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
What do you think, Kai?</b></font>

15
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why would you be asking me?</b></font>

16
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU] Well,
you're like, her caretaker</b></font>

17
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:38,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or something, aren't ya?</b></font>

18
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

19
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:41,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmph.</b></font>

20
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Uka gasps]
-[KAI] Can you handle it?</b></font>

21
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh-huh.</b></font>

22
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:47,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Cause you can't just quit.</b></font>

23
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't.</b></font>

24
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:51,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Gotta see it through
to the end.</b></font>

25
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I will!
-[KAMAKIRI] Sounds like</b></font>

26
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:53,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she's in!</b></font>

27
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:55,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKINO]
What are we gonna do?</b></font>

28
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:57,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MIRU] A manga cafe!
-[TONBO] Haunted house!</b></font>

29
00:00:57,850 --> 00:00:59,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
You got this, Ishimori!</b></font>

30
00:00:59,690 --> 00:01:00,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

31
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:03,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I won't let them down!</b></font>

32
00:01:03,810 --> 00:01:05,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll be tough,
but I'll pull this off!</b></font>

33
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:07,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everybody's counting on me!</b></font>

34
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE COMMITTEE MEMBER 6A]
All right, people, make sure</b></font>

35
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the tarp is down,
and be on your way!</b></font>

36
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Lots to do, so no napping!
-Oh, you're on the committee?</b></font>

37
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:43,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
Oh, that's wonderful!</b></font>

38
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's your theme?</b></font>

39
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:46,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
A cafe,</b></font>

40
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:48,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if the student council
gives their approval.</b></font>

41
00:02:48,670 --> 00:02:50,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
I wish I didn't have to work.</b></font>

42
00:02:51,170 --> 00:02:53,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd love to grab a bite
at your cafe.</b></font>

43
00:02:53,130 --> 00:02:54,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[beeps]</b></font>

44
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:55,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

45
00:02:55,930 --> 00:02:58,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems like you're having
a lot of fun lately, huh?</b></font>

46
00:03:00,010 --> 00:03:02,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm. I am, yeah!</b></font>

47
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's true.</b></font>

48
00:03:03,730 --> 00:03:06,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel there's finally a place
where I belong.</b></font>

49
00:03:06,850 --> 00:03:08,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I've got support
from the whole class!</b></font>

50
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

51
00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:14,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

52
00:03:18,410 --> 00:03:19,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[screaming]</b></font>

53
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

54
00:03:23,790 --> 00:03:24,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

55
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's with all the rush?</b></font>

56
00:03:30,170 --> 00:03:31,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh. It's you!</b></font>

57
00:03:32,250 --> 00:03:33,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where's everyone else?</b></font>

58
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:35,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Well, I just thought</b></font>

59
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:37,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd get all the stuff
we need myself.</b></font>

60
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:38,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Oh, yeah?</b></font>

61
00:03:40,390 --> 00:03:42,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe we could've been cooler
about all that.</b></font>

62
00:03:43,270 --> 00:03:44,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
Cooler to Ishimori?</b></font>

63
00:03:44,930 --> 00:03:48,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like, the plan so far
was just "a cafe."</b></font>

64
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:51,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So why should we bust our butts
collecting boxes and stuff?</b></font>

65
00:03:51,270 --> 00:03:52,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[NAGANO] I know, right?
-I don't wanna</b></font>

66
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:54,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>do some stupid maid cafe.</b></font>

67
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] Well, then,
why did you raise your hand?</b></font>

68
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAGANO]
I hated the other ideas more,</b></font>

69
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:59,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so, process of elimination.</b></font>

70
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:00,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

71
00:04:02,330 --> 00:04:03,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both groan]</b></font>

72
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:04,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TAO] Not cool.
-[SHIRAISHI] Not cool.</b></font>

73
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:05,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
The reason she didn't throw</b></font>

74
00:04:05,830 --> 00:04:07,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a single suggestion out there</b></font>

75
00:04:07,410 --> 00:04:09,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was just so she could bitch
about all of it later.</b></font>

76
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:10,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
So typical.</b></font>

77
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:11,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, now.</b></font>

78
00:04:11,540 --> 00:04:13,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Pretty big talk for someone
who flat out</b></font>

79
00:04:13,250 --> 00:04:14,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>refused to help at all.</b></font>

80
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna do a cafe.</b></font>

81
00:04:16,010 --> 00:04:19,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our class is just selling baked
goods from the grocery.</b></font>

82
00:04:19,590 --> 00:04:21,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I still can't believe
you guys won.</b></font>

83
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:22,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL]
Huh?</b></font>

84
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What did we win?</b></font>

85
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 6A] Every class
wanted to do a cafe.</b></font>

86
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But Ishimori got up
in front of everyone</b></font>

87
00:04:27,770 --> 00:04:30,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and unveiled this super
detailed plan for it.</b></font>

88
00:04:30,850 --> 00:04:31,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And she was like,</b></font>

89
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:34,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"I know our class can do
a great job with it."</b></font>

90
00:04:34,650 --> 00:04:37,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, she was shaking
like a leaf the entire time.</b></font>

91
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both groan]</b></font>

92
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:43,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 6A]
Sucks for us.</b></font>

93
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:44,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all groan]</b></font>

94
00:04:44,910 --> 00:04:46,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 6B]
A maid cafe would be cute!</b></font>

95
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all groan]</b></font>

96
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:50,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
They said no, huh?</b></font>

97
00:04:51,710 --> 00:04:53,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah. Sorry.</b></font>

98
00:04:53,210 --> 00:04:55,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess I still haven't
learned to "vibe" yet.</b></font>

99
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
So what?</b></font>

100
00:04:56,590 --> 00:04:58,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not like you have to,
or anything.</b></font>

101
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm confused.</b></font>

102
00:05:00,010 --> 00:05:02,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're probably the only person
who'd say that to me.</b></font>

103
00:05:03,050 --> 00:05:04,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
'Cause I'm an idiot.</b></font>

104
00:05:06,010 --> 00:05:08,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna know what's your
definition of "idiot?"</b></font>

105
00:05:08,730 --> 00:05:09,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

106
00:05:10,190 --> 00:05:11,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Someone who breaks the rules.</b></font>

107
00:05:11,940 --> 00:05:13,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But whose rules
are you breaking?</b></font>

108
00:05:13,690 --> 00:05:16,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Adults' and all the people
who suck up to 'em.</b></font>

109
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:19,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

110
00:05:19,820 --> 00:05:21,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

111
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
What's that look about?</b></font>

112
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm just listening.</b></font>

113
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:28,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, you decided you'd live
by your own rules?</b></font>

114
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure, in a twisted way.</b></font>

115
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:33,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
If I had to choose between</b></font>

116
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>living by the adults'
rules or yours,</b></font>

117
00:05:36,210 --> 00:05:37,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd pick yours.</b></font>

118
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure that everyone
you know would, too.</b></font>

119
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

120
00:05:42,970 --> 00:05:44,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
I'm not some kinda God.</b></font>

121
00:05:44,550 --> 00:05:45,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just a stupid punk.</b></font>

122
00:05:46,390 --> 00:05:47,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
You're unique.</b></font>

123
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why
when you always guide me</b></font>

124
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:51,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in a different direction,
it still feels right.</b></font>

125
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:54,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You give me advice
I wouldn't get from any adult.</b></font>

126
00:05:54,690 --> 00:05:56,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Crap.
I gotta bail.</b></font>

127
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:58,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't worry about my rules.</b></font>

128
00:05:59,110 --> 00:06:00,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You make the rules now.</b></font>

129
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:02,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's what committee
members do, right?</b></font>

130
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:05,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[plane whirring]</b></font>

131
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

132
00:06:10,410 --> 00:06:11,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[beeping]</b></font>

133
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:15,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

134
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:21,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

135
00:06:23,930 --> 00:06:25,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[screaming]
[thuds]</b></font>

136
00:06:27,390 --> 00:06:28,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

137
00:06:30,270 --> 00:06:32,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[eagles screeching]
-[breathing heavily]</b></font>

138
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:35,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What am I even doing?</b></font>

139
00:06:35,650 --> 00:06:37,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, no, what happened to you?</b></font>

140
00:06:38,150 --> 00:06:40,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You okay? Can you move?</b></font>

141
00:06:41,820 --> 00:06:42,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
She's sweating?</b></font>

142
00:06:42,780 --> 00:06:45,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] How far do we
have to carry these boxes?</b></font>

143
00:06:45,610 --> 00:06:47,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Oh, and uh, where are we
going? -Can we see your plan?</b></font>

144
00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:49,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're sorry about before.</b></font>

145
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We promise to help you.</b></font>

146
00:06:50,490 --> 00:06:52,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's right.
We'll work together.</b></font>

147
00:06:53,330 --> 00:06:55,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] No one's ever talked
to me like this.</b></font>

148
00:06:56,210 --> 00:06:57,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not even my parents.</b></font>

149
00:06:58,420 --> 00:07:00,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
You are okay, right?</b></font>

150
00:07:00,130 --> 00:07:01,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] If you're hurt,
we'll take you to see</b></font>

151
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:02,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the nurse.
No problem!</b></font>

152
00:07:02,300 --> 00:07:03,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAGANO]
We don't mind.</b></font>

153
00:07:05,470 --> 00:07:06,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all laugh]</b></font>

154
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:11,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Gotta see it
through to the end.</b></font>

155
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You make the rules now.</b></font>

156
00:07:16,350 --> 00:07:17,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

