461
00:18:25,190 --> 00:18:27,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ayumi! Ayumi! Ayumi! Ayumi!</b></font>

462
00:18:29,570 --> 00:18:30,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Wow.</b></font>

463
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:33,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never agreed
to something like this!</b></font>

464
00:18:33,530 --> 00:18:34,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT OPERATIONS 6A]
Some of the guys are only</b></font>

465
00:18:34,660 --> 00:18:35,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in it because of you!</b></font>

466
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not my problem!</b></font>

467
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:38,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT OPERATIONS 6A]
Fine, then!</b></font>

468
00:18:38,370 --> 00:18:40,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you don't wanna do it,
find me someone who will!</b></font>

469
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:41,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

470
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:44,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So you expect me to find
my own replacement?</b></font>

471
00:18:45,250 --> 00:18:46,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would you let me go out
in her place?</b></font>

472
00:18:47,170 --> 00:18:48,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-Huh?</b></font>

473
00:18:48,250 --> 00:18:49,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You sure about that?
-Yeah.</b></font>

474
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:52,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can make all the other girls
look better by comparison!</b></font>

475
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:53,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

476
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:54,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't talk like that. Girl.</b></font>

477
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:56,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's all right, I'll be okay!</b></font>

478
00:18:57,010 --> 00:18:58,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh?</b></font>

479
00:18:59,770 --> 00:19:01,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE MC 6A]
Welcome!</b></font>

480
00:19:01,390 --> 00:19:03,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now for the moment
you've waited for.</b></font>

481
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:04,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's "Let's Couple Up!"</b></font>

482
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:08,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's see if we can witness
true love bloom today!</b></font>

483
00:19:08,650 --> 00:19:11,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, our contestants
will all introduce themselves.</b></font>

484
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:12,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Do we have to?</b></font>

485
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:14,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suck at that.</b></font>

486
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:16,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder if Miura's
watching this.</b></font>

487
00:19:17,070 --> 00:19:18,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bet he'd be surprised.</b></font>

488
00:19:18,580 --> 00:19:20,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait. Don't think about that.</b></font>

489
00:19:20,580 --> 00:19:22,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've gotta be able
to do something</b></font>

490
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without roping him in.</b></font>

491
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:26,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE MC 6A]
Next up. Contestant 2!</b></font>

492
00:19:27,580 --> 00:19:28,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm ready!</b></font>

493
00:19:28,790 --> 00:19:31,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, well!
You're the famous Ishimori!</b></font>

494
00:19:31,380 --> 00:19:33,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Rather different
than I would've thought.</b></font>

495
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:35,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aren't ya?</b></font>

496
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:36,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

497
00:19:36,470 --> 00:19:37,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 6K]
Get it together, emcee!</b></font>

498
00:19:37,890 --> 00:19:39,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE MC 6A]
You're right, sorry!</b></font>

499
00:19:39,430 --> 00:19:41,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look at you, legs for days!</b></font>

500
00:19:42,060 --> 00:19:43,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE MC 6A]
What's better than a quiet girl</b></font>

501
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:44,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with a body like this?</b></font>

502
00:19:44,810 --> 00:19:45,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 6K]
A lotta stuff!</b></font>

503
00:19:45,810 --> 00:19:46,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

504
00:19:46,810 --> 00:19:48,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Is this another "vibe?"</b></font>

505
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:49,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Am I supposed to laugh?
-[MALE MC 6A] Well,</b></font>

506
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:51,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>don't judge a book
by its cover, lads!</b></font>

507
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:52,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

508
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:53,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE MC 6A] We've even
got the awkward laughter!</b></font>

509
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:55,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I almost wish Serina
had done this.</b></font>

510
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:58,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura would be here
in a heartbeat.</b></font>

511
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

512
00:19:59,620 --> 00:20:00,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

513
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:02,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] [groans]
What a pain.</b></font>

514
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

515
00:20:04,290 --> 00:20:06,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It feels like I can't ever
turn my back on you!</b></font>

516
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:09,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE MC 6A] What?
A last minute entrant?</b></font>

517
00:20:09,380 --> 00:20:11,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is Kai Miura joining?</b></font>

518
00:20:11,250 --> 00:20:13,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do you have to say?</b></font>

519
00:20:14,550 --> 00:20:17,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Sorry.
She's dropping out.</b></font>

520
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:19,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[indistinct chatter]
-[whimpering]</b></font>

521
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:22,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura. Thank you.</b></font>

522
00:20:23,930 --> 00:20:26,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know that I would
have been okay without you,</b></font>

523
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:28,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but still...
[sniffling]</b></font>

524
00:20:28,900 --> 00:20:31,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I want to be close to you
while I can be.</b></font>

525
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:33,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[weeping]
So I want to be strong for you.</b></font>

526
00:20:33,900 --> 00:20:35,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[weeping]</b></font>

527
00:20:41,330 --> 00:20:42,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[weeping]</b></font>

528
00:20:43,700 --> 00:20:44,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm with you.</b></font>

529
00:20:46,250 --> 00:20:47,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Always.</b></font>

530
00:20:48,250 --> 00:20:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

531
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[airplane droning]</b></font>

532
00:20:54,250 --> 00:20:58,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

533
00:21:02,470 --> 00:21:03,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
If I recall,</b></font>

534
00:21:04,010 --> 00:21:06,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you said you're not interested
in Uka like that.</b></font>

535
00:21:07,270 --> 00:21:08,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Who cares what I said?</b></font>

536
00:21:09,190 --> 00:21:12,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But since you keep asking,
I take it back.</b></font>

537
00:21:13,650 --> 00:21:14,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

538
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:17,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

539
00:21:20,820 --> 00:21:24,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

